{"dur": 25.47, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Qui signe ce plan ?", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.227, "words": [{"w": "Qui", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "signe", "t": 1.416}, {"w": "ce", "t": 1.74}, {"w": "plan", "t": 1.902}, {"w": "?", "t": 2.173}]}, {"id": "suspense", "text": "Pas la machine.", "t0": 3.127, "t1": 4.015, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "t": 3.127}, {"w": "la", "t": 3.364}, {"w": "machine.", "t": 3.541}]}, {"id": "verite", "text": "L'intelligence artificielle calcule, propose, vérifie. Mais elle ne porte rien.", "t0": 4.815, "t1": 10.185, "words": [{"w": "L'intelligence", "t": 4.815}, {"w": "artificielle", "t": 5.875}, {"w": "calcule,", "t": 6.793}, {"w": "propose,", "t": 7.359}, {"w": "vérifie.", "t": 7.924}, {"w": "Mais", "t": 8.489}, {"w": "elle", "t": 8.843}, {"w": "ne", "t": 9.196}, {"w": "porte", "t": 9.408}, {"w": "rien.", "t": 9.832}]}, {"id": "responsabilite", "text": "Le jour où un ouvrage bouge, c'est un nom qui est en bas du plan. Pas un logiciel.", "t0": 10.565, "t1": 15.93, "words": [{"w": "Le", "t": 10.565}, {"w": "jour", "t": 10.766}, {"w": "où", "t": 11.102}, {"w": "un", "t": 11.303}, {"w": "ouvrage", "t": 11.504}, {"w": "bouge,", "t": 12.041}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 12.443}, {"w": "un", "t": 12.845}, {"w": "nom", "t": 13.047}, {"w": "qui", "t": 13.315}, {"w": "est", "t": 13.583}, {"w": "en", "t": 13.851}, {"w": "bas", "t": 14.053}, {"w": "du", "t": 14.321}, {"w": "plan.", "t": 14.522}, {"w": "Pas", "t": 14.857}, {"w": "un", "t": 15.126}, {"w": "logiciel.", "t": 15.327}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "CivRebar AI t'assiste. Toi, tu décides. Et tu signes.", "t0": 16.31, "t1": 20.453, "words": [{"w": "CivRebar", "t": 16.31}, {"w": "AI", "t": 17.056}, {"w": "t'assiste.", "t": 17.305}, {"w": "Toi,", "t": 18.133}, {"w": "tu", "t": 18.465}, {"w": "décides.", "t": 18.713}, {"w": "Et", "t": 19.376}, {"w": "tu", "t": 19.625}, {"w": "signes.", "t": 19.873}]}, {"id": "fin", "text": "Abonne-toi, et garde la main.", "t0": 20.833, "t1": 22.494, "words": [{"w": "A